      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t this be changed to:\n```\nif (size \u003d\u003d 0 || addr + size \u003c addr || PAGE_ALIGN(addr + size) \u003c (addr + size))?\n```\n\nOtherwise this check will give incorrect result:\ne.g. size \u003d 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF, addr \u003d 0x1FFF\nPAGE_ALIGN(addr + size) will be 0x2000\nPAGE_ALIGN_DOWN(0x1FFF) will be 0x1000\n\nand for page_alinged being false this function will return true",
